{"id":480,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"高潔善美と研鑽力を育む相模女子","feature_description":"相模女子大学中学部・高等部は『高潔善美』を建学の精神に、研鑽力・発想力・協働力を教育目標として掲げています。学校生活では年間行事や部活動が充実し、大学や学園全体との連携も強みです。生徒が自ら学び、しなやかに発想し、社会で力を発揮することをめざします。広いキャンパスを生かした活動と、学園内の連携が学びを支えます。部活動の選択肢も幅広く整っています。","clubs":[{"id":9509,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9510,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9511,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9512,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9513,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9514,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9515,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9516,"name":"チアリーディング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9517,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9518,"name":"モダンダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9519,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9520,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.sagami-wu.ac.jp/chukou/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9521,"name":"演劇部","cat